tps://opm.gov.mt/en/public-bodies/data-governance-council/", "snippet": "The Data Governance Council, serves as the principal advisory and consultative body on data-related matters within the Public Administration. Its role has been formalized and expanded under the Organisational Structures for Data Sharing and Re-Use Regulations (S.L. 546.01), which provides the legal basis for the governance of official registers and the implementation of open data and data-sharing policies.", "title": "Data Governance Council - office of the prime minister", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://mdia.gov.mt/news/navigating-the-data-economy-implications-of-the-data-governance-act/", "snippet": "The Malta Digital Innovation Authority (MDIA) and the Data Governance Council work together to implement the Data Governance Act (DGA) in Malta. MDIA is responsible for registering Data Altruism Organisations and Data Intermediation Services, leveraging its track record in supporting digital innovation businesses.", "title": "Navigating the data economy: Implications of ...", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/katina-d-onise-am-3a1b64144_datagovernance-datasecurity-datavalue-activity-7284730488974426112-tZn5", "snippet": "Malta''s Public Administration Data Strategy 2023\u20132027 is one example, aiming to create a data\u2011empowered society by improving accessibility, collaborating with stakeholders and adopting international standards", "title": "Katina D''Onise AM''s Post", "provider": "diy"}]');
