/2023/48/three-quarters-of-dutch-adults-worry-about-impact-of-climate-change", "https://data.overheid.nl/assessment-impact-data-2021", "https://data.overheid.nl/en/dataset/pbl-euregio-database-2000-2010", "https://data.overheid.nl/dataset/cb25a3eb-f171-4a53-9097-d3d8624023ea", "https://data.overheid.nl/en/dataset/4736-waste-balance--kind-of-waste-per-sector--national-accounts--2008-2012", "https://data.overheid.nl/dataset/4725-environmental-accounts--origin-and-destination--waste--1990-2010"]',1.0,'native',NULL,NULL,6876,644,9286,0.010096,'haiku_h45',22,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
