roduced by CBS are a public good; public access is therefore a fundamental element of its statistics. As also prescribed by the European Statistics Code of Practice, CBS actively publishes all results of its statistical research on its website. Open data are made available on the CBS open data portal and interactively through StatLine.", "title": "CBS Multi-annual Programme 2024-2028", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/discussion-papers/2023/developing-a-material-flow-monitor-for-the-netherlands-from-national-statistical-data?onepage=true", "snippet": "To accelerate the EU''s transition to a circular economy, the European Commission adopted the new Circular Economy Action Plan in March 2020 (European Commission, 2021). It is one of the main blocks of the European Green Deal, Europe''s new agenda for sustainable growth. The action plan states that monitoring must rely on European statistics as much as possible.", "title": "Developing a material flow monitor for the Netherlands from national ...", "provider": "diy"}]');
