ive ways of tackling non-response, response burden and shrinking budgets. One way as demonstrated at the conference by CBS is Standard Business Reporting, which allows businesses to submit their data quickly and safely.", "title": "The international road to new forms of data collection - CBS", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/about-us/innovation/news/recent/cbs-google-and-dataprovider-develop-new-method-to-measure-internet-economy", "snippet": "The Dutch project has a triple objective for Google: to provide an unambiguous definition of the term internet economy, to determine the size of the internet economy \u00e1nd to develop new methods for production of statistics.", "title": "CBS, Google and Dataprovider develop new method to measure ...", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/data-gebruiken/zoeken-naar-data", "snippet": "Data.overheid.nl offers data users support in finding government data. The portal assists in opening data that are not yet available, in making data findable, and supports in finding contacts within the government in terms of data. ... The indicators measured by data.overheid.nl: Quality of links: we measure this through a link checker. The number of working links has to be above 95%. Data owners are asked to adjust datasets with non-working links. If this does not happen, the dataset will be removed from data.overheid.nl.", "title": "Searching for Data - Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}]');
