```','2026-07-12 13:49:03','[{"provider": "diy", "ms": 16887, "results": 4, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 14075, "results": 3, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 16335, "results": 3, "ok": true, "error": null}]','exp32_model_haiku','[{"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/open-data/beleid", "snippet": "In 2019, the Ministry of the Interior and Kingdom Relations published the Government Data Agenda (''Data Agenda Overheid'') on behalf of the cabinet. This agenda follows the National Open Data Agenda. The Government Data Agenda is an intergovernmental agenda that sets out what the government will do to better deal with personal data, open data and big data. The agenda describes how data can better benefit policy-making and the solution of social issues by the government.", "title": "Open data policy | Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "snippet": "The statistics produced by CBS are a public good; public access is therefore a fundamental element of its statistics. As also prescribed by the European Statistics Code of Practice, CBS actively publishes all results of its statistical research on its website. Open data are made available on the CBS open data portal and interactively through StatLine.", "title": "CBS Multi-annual Programme 2024-2028", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/corporate/2021/02/cbs-examines-the-value-of-data", "snippet": "The CBS study suggests that, measured in annual expenditure, the value of data in the Netherlands ranged between 15.6 and 20 billion euros in 2017 and increases every year. Especially the category data science has seen strong growth.", "title": "CBS examines the value of data", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "http://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/open-data/begrippenkader", "snippet": "Within the government there are data sets that are essential for boosting the use of government data. These data sets form so-called \"anchor points\" for the use of data. These datasets are also referred to as referential data sets. Lists of population numbers, index figures from Statistics Netherlands, the real estate dashboard from the Land Registry, or government organizations from KOOP are examples of this type of referential data. The referential data sets are prominently disclosed on data.o", "title": "Relevant concepts - Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/open-data/beleid", "snippet": "In 2019 heeft het Ministerie van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties namens het kabinet de Data Agenda Overheid gepubliceerd. Deze agenda volgt de Nationale Open Data Agenda op. De Data Agenda Overheid is een interbestuurlijke agenda, waarin staat wat de overheid gaat doen om beter om te gaan met persoonsgegevens, open data en big data. In de agenda staat beschreven hoe data beter ten goede kunnen komen aan beleidsvorming en het oplossen van maatschappelijke vraagstukken door de overheid.", "title": "Open data beleid | Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/nederlandse-digitaliseringsstrategie-nds/", "snippet": "Met de Nederlandse Digitaliseringsstrategie (NDS) prioriteren Rijksoverheid, provincies, gemeenten, waterschappen en publieke dienstverleners de onderwerpen waar de urgentie en impact het grootst is. We willen versnellen door politiek-bestuurlijke sturing op het realiseren van doorbraken en het wegnemen van belemmeringen.", "title": "Nederlandse Digitaliseringsstrategie (NDS) - Digitale Overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/overzicht-van-alle-onderwerpen/artificiele-intelligentie-ai/", "snippet": "Uitgangspunt is dat de Nederlandse samenleving optimaal gebruik gaat maken van AI. Maar wel op zo''n manier dat publieke waarden en mensenrechten zoals het verbod van discriminatie, privacy en autonomie voorop staan en geborgd zijn. Want ook in deze tijd waarin intelligente computersystemen in staat zijn om razendsnel enorme hoeveelheden data te verwerken moeten belangrijke rechten van mensen gegarandeerd blijven. Het ministerie van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties (BZK) bevordert de ver", "title": "AI (Artifici\u00eble Intelligentie) - Digitale Overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/assessment-impact-data-2021", "snippet": "Assessing the impact of open data is still generally considered a new field, with no consensus, for example, on the definition, or methodologies to measure impact. Nonetheless there are several elements that are considered essential to demonstrating impact, first and foremost monitoring mechanisms, but also proxies of impact \u2013 such as the degree of re-use of published open data.", "title": "Assessment of the Impact of data 2021 - Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/impact-en", "snippet": "Impact is the effect that opening open data for reuse has to solve economic and social problems.", "title": "Impact of data | Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}]');
