hods for creating new statistics, but it also provides (preliminary) figures. The report focuses on companies that produce AI, companies that use AI, educational programmes that focus on AI and how these are feeding through into the labour market, and the demand for workers with AI skills. The research was commissioned by TNO (the Netherlands Organisation for Applied Scientifi", "title": "Dutch AI monitor 2024 - CBS", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/about-us/who-we-are/our-organisation/privacy", "snippet": "CBS meets the most stringent requirements as regards data protection. Every year, a privacy audit takes place which is carried out by an accredited external organisation and which results in a Privacy Audit Proof certificate. This is how CBS demonstrates its compliance with the regulations of the GDPR (the accountability principle). ... CBS has its own Data Protection Officer (DPO). This officer monitors the implementation of and compliance with the GDPR by CBS and keeps a register of all personal data processing at CBS. The Dutch Data Protection Authority (DPA) supervises compliance with regulations of the law concerning personal data protection.", "title": "Privacy - CBS", "provider": "diy"}]');
