amework (RDF). SPARQL can help to find specific information from a large amount of RDF dataset, even if it organized in a complex way. To access the data of the European Data Portal, a machine-readable SPARQL endpoint allows querying the RDF descriptions of datasets.", "title": "SPARQL - Documentation of the European Data Portal (EDP) - GitLab", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://ndiqparate.al/", "snippet": "Informacioni i ofruar nga AIS permes dy portaleve Spending Data Albania dhe Open Data Albania ka te plote cdo pagese, transaksion thesari te realizuar.", "title": "Open Data Albania", "provider": "diy"}]');
