g and maintaining web applications is costly, a lot of the data published in SPARQL endpoints is difficult to explore by users that are not experts of LOD tools and languages. In order to make that data more accessible we developed SparqlExplorer, a web application that can be plugged into any SPARQL endpoint to make its content browsable without writing a single query by applying views to render web pages.", "title": "TOOLS - SparqlExplorer, exploring Linked Open Data - TIB AV-Portal", "provider": "diy"}]');
