 AKSHI, and the Ministry of Finance and Economy (in 2024).", "title": "Data-Driven Governance: Strategies for Open Data in the Western ...", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://osfwb.org/birn-presents-key-findings-on-open-data-and-digitalization-in-albania/", "snippet": "On October 25, 2024, BIRN Albania unveiled the main findings of the regional report \"Open Data and Digitalization in the Western Balkans: The State of Play\" to an audience of 25 professionals from media, research, and activist sectors. Moderated by Kristina Voko, Executive Director of BIRN Albania and a national researcher for the study, the event highlighted critical insights into Albania''s legal framework, strategies, and challenges related to open data and digitalization.", "title": "BIRN Presents Key Findings on Open Data and Digitalization in ...", "provider": "diy"}]');
