esignated, is maintained and/or restored, in order to ensure their long-term survival/existence. ... This dataset consists of part of the Strategic Proposals and Marine Objectives as published in the Strategic Plan for the Environment and Development (SPED). It shows the location of a Strategic Open Gap which should be kept free from further urban development. ... The basis for the reporting of administrative and identification data captured within the Registry, originates in two fundamental legal instruments, namely the Industrial Emissions Directive and the E-PRTR Regulation. The Registry provides spatial information on regulated industrial sites in Malta and is the reference dataset for thematic reporting on entities identified in it.", "title": "89 datasets found - Malta Data Portal", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://portal.data.gov.mt/en_GB/dataset/?_theme_limit=0&res_format=wms&page=7", "snippet": "Register of Industrial Sites\nEnvironmentThe basis for the reporting of administrative and identification data captured within the Registry, originates in two fundamental legal instruments, namely the Industrial Emissions Directive and the E-PRTR Regulation. The Registry provides spatial information on regulated industrial sites in Malta and is the reference dataset for thematic reporting on entities identified in it. ... Strategic open gap\nEnvironmentThis dataset consists of part of the Strategic Proposals and Marine Objectives as published in the Strategic Plan for the Environment and Development (SPED). It shows the location of a Strategic Open Gap which should be kept free from further urban development. ... Radiation Water Points 2019\nEnvironmentWater samples are collected from three points along Malta and Gozo on a quarterly basis. Samples are sent to an accredited Laboratory for radionuclide analysis. Such monitoring is carried out according to the requirements arising from Commission Recommendation 2000/473/Euratom.", "title": "Dataset - servizz pubbli