h data is released. Regular reporting to the public will be implemented to maintain transparency and accountability, providing insights into the data access process and performance metrics. ... - Access to Personal Health Data: Individuals will have easy access to their electronic health data, including the ability to share it with healthcare professionals across the EU.", "title": "Malta Health Data Access Body - The Directorate", "provider": "diy"}]');
