rk Services\n- Data and Service Sharing\n- Monitoring and Reporting ... Service metadata provides basic information about a service instance to enable the discovery of spatial data services. The description of a service includes the service type, a description of the operations and their parameters as well as information about the geographic information available from a service offering.", "title": "Malta Spatial Data Infrastructure", "provider": "diy"}]');
