ltruism and for data intermediation services in line with the Data Governance Act.\nThe MDIA is also the designated competent authority for all the provisions of the Data Act, except for Articles 23\u201331 and Articles 34\u201335. ... The Data Governance Act sets a common framework for data governance, including conditions for reusing public sector data, a framework for data intermediation services, voluntary registration for data altruism entities, and the establishment of a European Data Innovation Board.", "title": "Data - MDIA", "provider": "diy"}]');
