ght discrepancies in totals or calculated values. ... Quarterly data is available by type of employment (total, employed, self-employed) in persons and hours worked, both unadjusted and seasonally adjusted. \u2022 Economic activity is classified in accordance with the NACE Rev. 2 classification.", "title": "Dataset - servizz pubbliku", "provider": "diy"}]');
