}','2026-07-12 18:04:14','[{"provider": "diy", "ms": 28004, "results": 5, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 31964, "results": 5, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 32041, "results": 5, "ok": true, "error": null}]','exp36_model_opus','[{"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/open-data/beleid", "snippet": "In 2019, the Ministry of the Interior and Kingdom Relations published the Government Data Agenda (''Data Agenda Overheid'') on behalf of the cabinet. This agenda follows the National Open Data Agenda. The Government Data Agenda is an intergovernmental agenda that sets out what the government will do to better deal with personal data, open data and big data. The agenda describes how data can better benefit policy-making and the solution of social issues by the government.", "title": "Open data policy | Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/algemeen/over-dataoverheidnl", "snippet": "The data.overheid.nl team is responsible for implementing part of the open government policy: making available data sets findable and providing support to government organisations with opening data. The Ministry of the Interior and Kingdom Relations strives to keep the quality of the data sets optimal.", "title": "About data.overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/about-us/who-we-are/our-organisation/operational-management/government-related-information-management", "snippet": "On 1 May 2022, the Open Government Act (Wet open overheid, WOO) came into force. It has replaced the Government Information (Public Access) Act (WOB). The WOO ensures that private citizens can gain insight into the Dutch government\u2019s actions if and when applicable. In the Netherlands, public sector information must always be accessible to the public. An exception to this is when the requested information is classified by law as unsuitable for public disclosure. At CBS, this is particularly the c", "title": "Government-related information management - CBS", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/data-publiceren/api", "snippet": "An API is available for data.overheid.nl that makes the metadata of all available datasets available. All information on data.overheid.nl can be reused under the CC-0 license.", "title": "API | Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/about-us/innovation/news/open-data/how-to-protect-privacy-in-open-data", "snippet": "More and more government data is presented online as open data. Government information which can be shared and re-used easily enhances transparency. On the other hand, authorities publishing open data have an obligation to protect the privacy of individual citizens and companies. Statistics Netherlands (CBS) can lend a helping hand with its host of expertise in the protection of private data by offering a practical course. ... \u2018Up to what extent can we publish our information as open data without disclosing personal and corporate privacy-sensitive data? Various authorities including ministries, provincial and municipal governments are facing this issue\u2019, says Tanya Gelsema, policy staff member at CBS, \u2018And justifiably so. After all, the adage of \u2018open data\u2019 is that data are freely accessible as long as this sensitive formation does not lead to identification of individuals or companies.\u2019", "title": "How to protect privacy in open data - CBS", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "http://data.overheid.nl/", "snippet": "Welkom op het Nationale Dataportaal van de Nederlandse overheid: data.overheid.nl. Op dit portaal wordt Nederlandse overheidsdata beschreven, dit kan zowel open als gesloten zijn.\nLees meer over open data en doe mee", "title": "Data overheid: Dataregister van de Nederlandse Overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.rijksoverheid.nl/opendata", "snippet": "U mag openbare informatie van de Rijksoverheid hergebruiken. U kunt de informatie bijvoorbeeld gebruiken op websites en in applicaties. ... Beschikbare open data\nDe volgende open datasets van Rijksoverheid.nl zijn beschikbaar:", "title": "Open data | Rijksoverheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/overzicht-van-alle-onderwerpen/data/open-data/", "snippet": "De overheid wil informatie zoveel mogelijk beschikbaar maken via open data en open standaarden. Zo kunnen gegevens makkelijker uitgewisseld worden. Overheidsgegevens zijn actief beschikbaar als open data voor hergebruik van derden. Behalve als er goede redenen zijn om dat niet te doen.", "title": "Open Data - Digitale Overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/open-data/beleid", "snippet": "In 2019 heeft het Ministerie van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties namens het kabinet de Data Agenda Overheid gepubliceerd. Deze agenda volgt de Nationale Open Data Agenda op. De Data Agenda Overheid is een interbestuurlijke agenda, waarin staat wat de overheid gaat doen om beter om te gaan met persoonsgegevens, open data en big data. In de agenda staat beschreven hoe data beter ten goede kunnen komen aan beleidsvorming en het oplossen van maatschappelijke vraagstukken door de overheid.", "title": "Open data beleid | Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/data", "snippet": "Datasets\nEen overzicht van de beschikbare datasets en API''s op data.overheid.nl vind je hier.", "title": "Datasets van de Nederlandse overheid - Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "http://data.overheid.nl/en", "snippet": "Welkom op het Nationale Dataportaal van de Nederlandse overheid: data.overheid.nl. Op dit portaal wordt Nederlandse overheidsdata beschreven, dit kan zowel open als gesloten zijn.\nLees meer over open data en doe mee", "title": "Data register of the Dutch government | Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/open-data/wat-is-open-data", "snippet": "Wat zijn open data precies en hoe wordt het toegepast in Nederland? Deze acht uitgangspunten defini\u00ebren het kader voor het proactief beschikbaar stellen van open data van de overheid.", "title": "Wat is open data? - Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/actueel/nieuws/open-data-conferentie-2026", "snippet": "Op donderdag 22 januari 2026 organiseert het ministerie van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties de Open Data Conferentie 2026. De conferentie geldt als belangrijk startpunt voor de consultatie van een toekomstbestendig open data beleid, met als ambitie:\nOpen data als essentieel fundament van een transparante, innovatieve en democratische samenleving. Met data als publiek en collectief goed; toegankelijk en herbruikbaar waardoor maatschappelijke opgaven sneller en beter worden aangepakt.", "title": "Open Data Conferentie 2026 - Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}]');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_researcher_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,answer,answer_explanation,evidence_quote,source_url,retrieval_confidence,answer_confidence,search_queries_used,fetched_urls,domain_trust_score,language_route_used,notes,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,search_provider_calls,experiment_id,search_snippets) VALUES (9067,'2206f8e0-e541-4243-8cd3-e3d74cb9edb3','32791869-bc53-439f-9edf-2355486c503c','P10-b','NL',0,'inconclusive','The snippets discuss CBS statistical publishing and confidential microdata but provide no evidence that national data inventories specifically include data collected by public bodies that cannot be published as open data under the Data Governance Act.','Microdata (data collected at the level of the authorisation holders) are usually considered confidential and are not available to the public.','https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/aanvullende-statistische-diensten/2024/setting-up-a-new-register-for-biocide-sales-in-the-netherlands/3-practical-aspects-of-monitoring-biocide-sales',0.6,0.2,'["Netherlands data inventory non-open data protected data governance act", "gegevensinventaris overheid niet-openbare data datagovernanceverordening", "site:data.overheid.nl beschermde gegevens hergebruik Data Governance Act"]','["https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/aanvullende-statistische-diensten/2024/setting-up-a-new-register-for-biocide-sales-in-the-netherlands/3-practical-aspects-of-monitoring-biocide-sales"]',1.0,'native',NULL,NULL,3799,552,8923,0.032795000000000005,'opus_o48',22,'claude-opus-4-8','{
  "answer": "inconclusive",
  "answer_explanation": "The snippets discuss CBS statistical publishing and confidential microdata but provide no evidence that national data inventories specifically include data collected by public bodies that cannot be published as open data under the Data Governance Act.",
  "evidence_quote": "Microdata (data collected at the level of the authorisation holders) are usually considered confidential and are not available to the public.",
  "source_url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/aanvullende-statistische-diensten/2024/setting-up-a-new-register-for-biocide-sales-in-the-netherlands/3-practical-aspects-of-monitoring-biocide-sales",
  "retrieval_confidence": 0.6,
  "answer_confidence": 0.2,
  "search_queries_used": [
    "Netherlands data inventory non-open data protected data governance act",
    "gegevensinventaris overheid niet-openbare data datagovernanceverordening",
    "site:data.overheid.nl beschermde gegevens hergebruik Data Governance Act"
  ],
  "fetched_urls": [],
  "language_route_used": "native",
  "notes": "No snippet addresses whether national data inventories include non-publishable data per the Data Governance Act; confidentiality of microdata is not the same as inventory coverage of protected data."
}','2026-07-12 18:04:17','[{"provider": "diy", "ms": 19052, "results": 2, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 1019, "results": 0, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 1150, "results": 0, "ok": true, "error": null}]','exp36_model_opus','[{"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "snippet": "The statistics produced by CBS are a public good; public access is therefore a fundamental element of its statistics. As also prescribed by the European Statistics Code of Practice, CBS actively publishes all results of its statistical research on its website. Open data are made available on the CBS open data portal and interactively through StatLine. In line with the Open op Orde action plan (aimed at improving central government information management and transparency), CBS is also investing i ... In order to produce reliable statistics while simultaneously reducing the administrative burden for citizens and enterprises, CBS has been granted access to government data by law. Data that have already been collected by other government organisations can therefore be reused and consolidated for statistical purposes by CBS. CBS also collects information through surveys of enterprises, institutions and individuals. A complicating factor is that the societal reality is changing and new data sourc", "title": "CBS Multi-annual Programme 2024-2028", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/aanvullende-statistische-diensten/2024/setting-up-a-new-register-for-biocide-sales-in-the-netherlands/3-practical-aspects-of-monitoring-biocide-sales", "snippet": "Microdata (data collected at the level of the authorisation holders) are usually considered confidential and are not available to the public. The totals of these figures, which cannot be used to identify individual authorisation holders, may be published, however. These totals represent relevant environmental information, which is in the interest of the general public. A legal basis, taking into account the \u00c5rhus Convention, will be needed to determine exactly which totals (i.e. which aggregatio ... It is crucially important that microdata are never emailed (or otherwise communicated) outside the register holder\u2019s IT environment.\n- Ensure that users of the register can only be identified by their own internal ID number and that no other identifying information is visible. The link between the authorisation holder\u2019s number / Chamber of Commerce number and the user\u2019s own ID number will be stored separately (in a different location). This will limit the damage in the event of a leak.", "title": "3. Practical aspects of monitoring biocide sales - CBS", "provider": "diy"}]');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_researcher_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,answer,answer_explanation,evidence_quote,source_url,retrieval_confidence,answer_confidence,search_queries_used,fetched_urls,domain_trust_score,language_route_used,notes,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,search_provider_calls,experiment_id,search_snippets) VALUES (9068,'2206f8e0-e541-4243-8cd3-e3d74cb9edb3','5b776280-f9e8-432f-843b-c7c6a630a4b1','I3','NL',1,'inconclusive','The snippets show the government stimulates reuse of open data generally, but none provide verbatim evidence of activities, incentives, or obligations for public bodies to monitor the reuse of their own published data specifically.','De Rijksoverheid stimuleert het hergebruik van open data van de overheid.','https://www.rijksoverheid.nl/themas/overheid-en-democratie/digitale-overheid/open-overheid',0.7,0.4,'["Netherlands open data reuse measurement policy national government", "monitor hergebruik open data Rijksoverheid beleid stimuleren", "Nationale Open Data Agenda hergebruik monitoring overheid"]','["https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/corporate/2018/12/cbs-rises-to-2nd-position-in-open-data-inventory", "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/corporate/2019/28/knaw-improve-the-reuse-of-public-data-for-science", "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "https://www.rijksoverheid.nl/themas/overheid-en-democratie/digitale-overheid/open-overheid"]',1.0,'native',NULL,NULL,4554,1004,18415,0.047869999999999996,'opus_o48',22,'claude-opus-4-8','The snippets describe stimulating reuse of open data generally, but none describe activities encouraging public bodies to *monitor* the reuse of their own published data (incentives/obligations for public bodies to track reuse). Snippet [4] mentions the government stimulates reuse, but that''s not the same as monitoring reuse. No verbatim evidence supports either a confident "yes" (for monitoring activities specifically) with the required specificity.

However, the question asks whether activities exist to encourage reuse monitoring. The available evidence does not ground that specific claim, so despite the rejection, I cannot fabricate one. The closest honest, supportable reading: there is no evidence of monitoring-encouragement activities in these snippets.

