```','2026-07-12 18:05:26','[{"provider": "diy", "ms": 15753, "results": 1, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 8071, "results": 1, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 16553, "results": 2, "ok": true, "error": null}]','exp36_model_opus','[{"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/nl-nl/longread/rapportages/2023/cbs-jaarplan-2023?onepage=true", "snippet": "Gedetailleerde cijfers zijn al vele jaren gratis te raadplegen via de databank StatLine. Ook stelt het CBS zijn volledige databank als open data beschikbaar.", "title": "CBS Jaarplan 2023", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/open-data/beleid", "snippet": "In 2019 heeft het Ministerie van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties namens het kabinet de Data Agenda Overheid gepubliceerd. Deze agenda volgt de Nationale Open Data Agenda op. De Data Agenda Overheid is een interbestuurlijke agenda, waarin staat wat de overheid gaat doen om beter om te gaan met persoonsgegevens, open data en big data. In de agenda staat beschreven hoe data beter ten goede kunnen komen aan beleidsvorming en het oplossen van maatschappelijke vraagstukken door de overheid.", "title": "Open data beleid | Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/assessment-impact-data-2021", "snippet": "This page provides an assessment on the impact of the data that is available on data.overheid.nl. The assessment follows the structure of the EU maturity report 2021 for measuring the impact of data.", "title": "Assessment of the Impact of data 2021 - Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "snippet": "The statistics produced by CBS are a public good; public access is therefore a fundamental element of its statistics. As also prescribed by the European Statistics Code of Practice, CBS actively publishes all results of its statistical research on its website. Open data are made available on the CBS open data portal and interactively through StatLine. In line with the Open op Orde action plan (aimed at improving central government information management and transparency), CBS is also investing i ... The external evaluation of the efficiency, effectiveness and independence of CBS over the 2016-2020 period conducted by the external research firm KWINK shows that CBS is effective, that its efficiency has developed positively and that its internal governance functions well and provides sufficient safeguards. KWINK recommends increasing the transparency of the work programme, disclosing details in the work programme of statistics that were not produced, and making clear that the statistics provi", "title": "CBS Multi-annual Programme 2024-2028", "provider": "diy"}]');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_researcher_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,answer,answer_explanation,evidence_quote,source_url,retrieval_confidence,answer_confidence,search_queries_used,fetched_urls,domain_trust_score,language_route_used,notes,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,search_provider_calls,experiment_id,search_snippets) VALUES (9074,'2206f8e0-e541-4243-8cd3-e3d74cb9edb3','f40b0a93-9997-4360-ab59-5c182fe8c4d2','P5','NL',0,'yes','The Dutch PSI guidelines under the Wet hergebruik overheidsinformatie (Who) require government bodies to actively offer dynamic and real-time data such as sensor data via APIs, which constitutes a policy measure incentivising publication of and access to real-time/dynamic data.','Dit heeft betrekking op dynamische- of realtime gegevens, zoals sensordata, en op die high value datasets, waarvan de EU een lijst aan het samenstellen is.','https://data.overheid.nl/psi-richtlijnen',0.75,0.6,'["Netherlands open data strategy real-time dynamic data measures", "Nederland datastrategie realtime dynamische data beleid", "site:data.overheid.nl realtime dynamische data hergebruik"]','["https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "https://data.overheid.nl/psi-richtlijnen", "https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/overzicht-van-alle-onderwerpen/data/open-data/", "https://www.cbs.nl/nl-nl/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-meerjarenprogramma-2024-2028?onepage=true", "https://data.overheid.nl/impact-story-yazula", "https://data.overheid.nl/dataset/odn-parkeergarages"]',1.0,'native',NULL,NULL,4744,739,14424,0.042195,'opus_o48',22,'claude-opus-4-8','Looking at the snippets, the strongest evidence relates to the PSI directive implementation (Who - Wet hergebruik overheidsinformatie), which establishes measures for actively offering dynamic/real-time data. However, this reflects transposition of an EU directive rather than clearly a national strategy incentivising publication. Snippet [2] and [5] describe an active obligation to offer dynamic/real-time data.

