  "language_route_used": "native",
  "notes": "data.overheid.nl offers ''data communities'' as an exchange mechanism between data suppliers and re-users, plus a data request feature."
}','2026-07-12 18:08:39','[{"provider": "diy", "ms": 18045, "results": 2, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 15659, "results": 2, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 10898, "results": 3, "ok": true, "error": null}]','exp36_model_opus','[{"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/community/over-data-communities", "snippet": "Data.overheid.nl facilitates as a data broker between supply and demand of data. This makes it possible for the community to develop. In addition, at least one leader and a number of experts are linked to a community. The initiator is in fact the manager of the community, arranges the day-to-day affairs and draws up rules about the community where necessary. The experts provide the content on specific topics within the community. ... In an data community on data.overheid.nl the following topics can be found:\n- One central place for data within the topic. These data is visible and findable through metadata\n- As much as possible government data available from different government organizations\n- Shows in data what the involved organizations produce and publish\n- Gives insights in the available data, quality, but also contradictions in data\n- Givers insights in the involved parties, chains and network round an specific topic", "title": "About data communities", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/assessment-impact-data-2021", "snippet": "In 2020 we launched the data communities and impact stories on the National dataportal. Since 2019 we have an application catalogue for re-use and extensive statistics on user visits and clicks. This gives data owner great insights in the re-use of their data. ... The data communities empower public bodies to be in contact with the re-users of their data. The incentive is here that datasets are more visible, get more attention and at the end provide value.", "title": "Assessment of the Impact of data 2021 - Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/open-data/inhoudelijke-standaarden", "snippet": "Do you also have a standard or would you like to know more about the subject? Please feel free to contact the data.overheid.nl team via data@koop.overheid.nl.", "title": "Standards for data sets - Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning-donl", "snippet": "Neem contact met ons op\nJe kunt op verschillende manieren contact met ons zoeken ... Informatie voor gebruikers over het gebruik van data.overheid.nl", "title": "Ondersteuning | Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/communities/onderwijsdata/community/datarequest/4645", "snippet": "Dataverzoek\n| Dataverzoek nummer: | 2774 |\n|---|---|\n| Fase: | Data is beschikbaar |\n| Status: | Afgehandeld |\n| Laatst aangepast: | 5 years 2 months geleden |", "title": "Adressen alle vestigingen van alle AOC instellingen | Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/community/datarequest/energieverbruik-particuliere-woningen-in-postcode-9321", "snippet": "Dataverzoek\n| Dataverzoek nummer: | 2720 |\n|---|---|\n| Fase: | Data is beschikbaar |\n| Status: | Afgehandeld |\n| Laatst aangepast: | 5 years 3 months geleden |", "title": "energieverbruik particuliere woningen in postcode 9321", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/community/datarequest/uitslag-curacao", "snippet": "Dataverzoek\n| Dataverzoek nummer: | 2753 |\n|---|---|\n| Fase: | Data is beschikbaar |\n| Status: | Afgehandeld |\n| Laatst aangepast: | 5 years 3 months geleden |", "title": "Uitslag Curacao | Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}]');
