ta beschreven, dit kan zowel open als gesloten zijn.\nLees meer over open data en doe mee", "title": "Data register of the Dutch government | Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}]');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_researcher_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,answer,answer_explanation,evidence_quote,source_url,retrieval_confidence,answer_confidence,search_queries_used,fetched_urls,domain_trust_score,language_route_used,notes,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,search_provider_calls,experiment_id,search_snippets) VALUES (9117,'2206f8e0-e541-4243-8cd3-e3d74cb9edb3','c72b0661-9b1b-4844-9f6c-d2e2f934c5f0','PT39','NL',1,'no','The Dutch national portal explicitly restricts publishing rights to government organisations only, meaning non-official/community-sourced data cannot be published as datasets.','Alleen (overheids)organisaties worden goedgekeurd als "data-eigenaar".','https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/data-publiceren/datasets-publiceren',0.9,0.75,'["data.overheid.nl dataset aanmelden wie mag publiceren voorwaarden", "data overheid nl bronhouder overheidsorganisatie eis publicatie", "data.overheid.nl community data non-government dataset example"]','["https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/data-publiceren/datasets-publiceren", "https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/data-publiceren/licentie-keuze", "https://data.overheid.nl/aanleveren-van-informatie-aan-dataoverheidnl-de-api", "https://data.overheid.nl/assessment-impact-data-2021"]',1.0,'native',NULL,NULL,4627,559,9953,0.03711,'opus_o48',22,'claude-opus-4-8','{
  "answer": "no",
  "answer_explanation": "The Dutch national portal explicitly restricts publishing rights to government organisations only, meaning non-official/community-sourced data cannot be published as datasets.",
  "evidence_quote": "Alleen (overheids)organisaties worden goedgekeurd als \"data-eigenaar\".",
