Snippet [4] describes a specific dataset covering "de volledige periode tot en met heden" (the complete period up to and including today), which demonstrates an effort to maintain complete time series. However, this describes a single dataset''s characteristics rather than a national-level policy or systematic effort. The evidence is thin for establishing a country-wide "yes" but does show intentional maintenance of complete series.

The strongest concrete evidence is snippet [4], which explicitly describes maintaining data over the full period to the present, including noting and explaining interruptions—an effort toward completeness.

