ng the landscape and biodiversity. The other snippets are datasets on data.overheid.nl (forbidden portal) or dataset listings, not reuse cases with demonstrated impact. [1] is on an allowed domain and describes an open-data initiative addressing biodiversity, but it is a funded proposal rather than clear evidence of realized impact on biodiversity protection. This makes a confident "yes" hard to ground.

