Initiatiefnemers: provincies Gelderland (regie) en Overijssel, gemeente Bronckhorst en Coöperatief Boomregister U.A.','https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/overzicht-van-alle-onderwerpen/innovatie/innovatiebudget/toekenning-innovatiebudget-2021/',0.85,0.6,'["Netherlands national support local regional open data initiatives", "ondersteuning lokale regionale open data initiatieven Rijksoverheid", "open data gemeenten provincies ondersteuning site:data.overheid.nl"]','["https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/about-us/innovation/news/big-data/statistics-netherlands-city-of-eindhoven-join-forces-to-launch-first-cbs-urban-data-center", "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/dossier/regional-statistics/cbs-urban-data-centres-substance-and-added-value", "https://data.overheid.nl/zoek/support?sort=score%20desc%2C%20sys_modified%20desc&search=%22verschillen%22", "https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/overzicht-van-alle-onderwerpen/innovatie/innovatiebudget/toekenning-innovatiebudget-2021/", "https://data.overheid.nl/community/maatschappij/high-value/gemeenten", "https://data.overheid.nl/community/maatschappij/high-value/provincies", "https://data.overheid.nl/gemeentelijke-high-value-datalijst"]',1.0,'native',NULL,NULL,5534,680,14263,0.044669999999999994,'opus_o48',22,'claude-opus-4-8','Sources [6], [7], [8] are on data.overheid.nl, which is forbidden. Source [5] (digitaleoverheid.nl) shows innovation budget for a provincial/municipal open data initiative — national support for local/regional initiatives.

