Snippet [1] (digitaleoverheid.nl) only says the government stimulates reuse; it doesn''t describe an activity to understand *which and how* datasets are reused.

Per rule 6, if the only supporting evidence sits on a forbidden source, I must return `inconclusive`. The non-forbidden snippet doesn''t ground the specific claim about measuring/understanding reuse.

