ed is voor hergebruik. De VNG ondersteunt hen daarbij door actief mee te denken, expertise in te brengen en verbindingen te leggen met andere gemeenten. De VNG maakt daarnaast de resultaten zichtbaar via congressen, webinars en artikelen. ... Utrecht, namens Platform Dienstverlening / G4 \u2013 Verantwoorde en eenduidige toegang op data;", "title": "8 pilots gaan uitvoeringskracht gemeenten versterken", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/evenementen/", "snippet": "Regiobijeenkomsten Digitalisering gemeentelijke uitvoeringspraktijk\nWil je weten wat digitalisering voor jouw gemeente betekent? De VNG organiseert een reeks regiobijeenkomsten.", "title": "Evenementen - Digitale Overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/data-publiceren/inventarisaties", "snippet": "At the beginning of 2017, the data.overheid.nl team carried out a data inventory among all data owners of the data portal. In contrast to the data inventories of 2015 and 2016, this year the inventory was not only carried out among data owners within central government. This year, all data owners took part in the inventory, including municipalities and provinces.", "title": "Data inventories | Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "http://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/open-data/begrippenkader", "snippet": "High Value | Decentraal: datasets that are primarily used at local and regional levels and belong to one of the categories outlined in lists created for municipalities and provinces. More information is available at https://data.overheid.nl/nationale-high-value-datasets.", "title": "Relevant concepts - Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/our-services/open-data", "snippet": "All datasets from StatLine are also part of the open data collection of the Dutch government, called data.overheid.nl (Dutch).", "title": "Open data | CBS", "provider": "diy"}]');
