d.nl/en/ondersteuning/algemeen/over-dataoverheidnl"]',1.0,'native',NULL,NULL,5965,779,12879,0.0493,'opus_o48',22,'claude-opus-4-8','Looking at the snippets, [2] on digitaleoverheid.nl describes governance structure — the IBDS program under the Ministry of BZK, steered by OBDO and IDO. This is a non-forbidden source describing responsibilities and governance.

