```','2026-07-12 18:22:14','[{"provider": "diy", "ms": 19027, "results": 2, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 12163, "results": 0, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 32999, "results": 3, "ok": true, "error": null}]','exp36_model_opus','[{"url": "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "snippet": "The statistics produced by CBS are a public good; public access is therefore a fundamental element of its statistics. As also prescribed by the European Statistics Code of Practice, CBS actively publishes all results of its statistical research on its website. Open data are made available on the CBS open data portal and interactively through StatLine. In line with the Open op Orde action plan (aimed at improving central government information management and transparency), CBS is also investing i ... We will increase the accessibility and hence use of our data. To this end, we are improving our services via Remote Access and StatLine/open data. We will also enable others to use or learn to use data effectively and, where necessary, we will seek access to new data sources ourselves in order to guarantee the quality of statistics in the future.", "title": "CBS Multi-annual Programme 2024-2028", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/assessment-impact-data-2021", "snippet": "In the Netherlands there is a strong focus on the interest in understanding the level of re-use of open data. The following document gives an overview of the activities / efforts within public bodies: https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/overzicht-van-alle-onderwerpen/nieuwe-technologieen-data-en-ethiek/data-agenda-overheid/planning-data-agenda-overheid/#problemen ... In 2020 we launched the data communities and impact stories on the National dataportal. Since 2019 we have an application catalogue for re-use and extensive statistics on user visits and clicks. This gives data owner great insights in the re-use of their data. We started work on developing an impact measuring framework. ... For 2022 we plan to develop a monitor based on the explicit relations, impact stories and available high value datasets for each organization.", "title": "Assessment of the Impact of data 2021 - Data overheid", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/open-data/beleid", "snippet": "De ''Visie Open Overheid'' en het bijbehorende actieplan ''Open Government Partnership'' (OGP) heeft minister Plasterk van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties namens het kabinet naar de Tweede Kamer gestuurd.", "title": "Open data beleid | Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/dataset/8fef0ad5-0aa1-4736-a0c9-02aac2ca678a", "snippet": "Dit bestand bevat de actieplannen geluid van de aangewezen agglomeratiegemeenten, conform het END-datamodel (Environmental Noise Directive).\nIedere vijf jaar stellen aangewezen overheden een geluidbelastingkaart en een actieplan op. Deze overheden zijn het Rijk, provincies en een aantal gemeenten. De gemeenten zijn vermeld in artikel 2.40, Omgevingsregeling. Hier zijn agglomeraties aangewezen die \u00e9\u00e9n of meer gemeenten omvatten.", "title": "Actieplannen geluid agglomeraties, 2025 | Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://data.overheid.nl/dataset/65936-actieplannen-geluid-hoofdwegen--2025", "snippet": "Dit bestand bevat de actieplannen geluid van de Nederlandse rijks- en provinciale wegen conform het END-datamodel (Environmental Noise Directive).\nIedere vijf jaar stellen aangewezen overheden een geluidbelastingkaart en een actieplan vast. Deze overheden zijn het Rijk, provincies en een aantal gemeenten. De verplichting komt voort uit de Europese richtlijn omgevingslawaai en is ge\u00efmplementeerd in de Omgevingswet.", "title": "Actieplannen geluid hoofdwegen, 2025 | Data overheid - Overheid.nl", "provider": "diy"}]');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_researcher_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,answer,answer_explanation,evidence_quote,source_url,retrieval_confidence,answer_confidence,search_queries_used,fetched_urls,domain_trust_score,language_route_used,notes,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,search_provider_calls,experiment_id,search_snippets) VALUES (9162,'2206f8e0-e541-4243-8cd3-e3d74cb9edb3','b74218ae-a8b3-4ff9-9ff0-587a2113b55f','P8','NL',0,'inconclusive','The evidence describing the Dutch national strategy (Data Agenda Overheid) and its reuse measures appears only on the forbidden data.overheid.nl domain, so no permissible source verbatim grounds a ''yes'' about national-strategy measures to support public-sector reuse.','In 2019 heeft het Ministerie van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties namens het kabinet de Data Agenda Overheid gepubliceerd.','https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/overzicht-van-alle-onderwerpen/europa/europese-wet-en-regelgeving/',0.6,0.35,'["Netherlands national open data strategy public sector reuse measures", "nationale strategie open data hergebruik overheid maatregelen", "open data hergebruik overheid site:data.overheid.nl"]','["https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/corporate/2018/12/cbs-rises-to-2nd-position-in-open-data-inventory", "https://data.overheid.nl/assessment-impact-data-2021", "https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/longread/diversen/2022/cbs-multi-annual-programme-2024-2028?onepage=true", "https://www.digitaleoverheid.nl/overzicht-van-alle-onderwerpen/europa/europese-wet-en-regelgeving/", "https://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/open-data/wat-is-open-data", "https://data.overheid.nl/licenties-voor-hergebruik", "https://data.overheid.nl/gesloten-datasets", "https://data.overheid.nl/actueel/nieuws/gebruikersonderzoek-overheidsdata", "http://data.overheid.nl/ondersteuning/open-data/beleid"]',1.0,'native',NULL,NULL,5742,900,18253,0.05121,'opus_o48',22,'claude-opus-4-8','Looking at the results, several are on forbidden domains (data.overheid.nl). I need a non-forbidden source. Result [4] on digitaleoverheid.nl is not forbidden and describes policy measures, but it describes an EU directive, not a national strategy. Let me evaluate.

The strongest non-forbidden evidence for a national strategy with reuse measures is [4] describing the directive promoting open data use. However, the question is specifically about the national strategy/policy. Results [9] and [2] describe the Data Agenda Overheid but are on forbidden data.overheid.nl.

[4] on digitaleoverheid.nl describes the directive but not a clear national strategy measure. The evidence for the national strategy''s reuse measures sits on forbidden sources ([9], [2]).

