es digjitale. Kjo strategji, shpesh eshte pjese e strategjise se agjendes digjitale kombetare, ose pjese e strategjise se reformes se administrates publike, me fokus perdorimin e TIK-ut ne permiresimin e ofrimit te sherbimeve ndaj qytetareve. Ne nivel OECD-je, 96% e vendeve kane nje strategji te tille.", "title": "https://akshi.gov.al/qeverisja-dixhitale-shqiperia...", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.opengovpartnership.org/documents/albania-action-plan-review-2023-2025/", "snippet": "Commitment 6 continues the publication of datasets to the open dataBy opening up data and making it sharable and reusable, governments can enable informed debate, better decision making, and the development of innovative new services. Technical specifications: Polici... portal, while Commitments 7-9 continue to enhance public services on the e-Albania portal. ... Commitments 2-4 aim to enhance data submission and data accuracy on the beneficial ownershipDisclosing beneficial owners \u2014 those who ultimately control or profit from a business \u2014 is essential for combating corruption, stemming illicit financial flows, and fighting tax evasion. Technical... More register, launched during the 2020-2022 plan.", "title": "Albania Action Plan Review 2023-2025", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://www.opengovpartnership.org/documents/albania-results-report-2023-2025/", "snippet": "Albania\u2019s 2023\u20132025 action plan had 24 commitments covering areas such as monitoring integrity plans, beneficial ownershipDisclosing beneficial owners \u2014 those who ultimately control or profit from a business \u2014 is essential for combating corruption, stemming illicit financial flows, and fighting tax evasion. Technical... More transparency, access to justiceAccessible justice systems \u2013 both formal and informal \u2013 ensure that individuals and communities with legal needs know where to go for help, ob", "title": "Albania Results Report 2023-2025 | Open Government Partnership", "provider": "diy"}]');
