}','2026-07-12 18:30:21','[{"provider": "diy", "ms": 4092, "results": 0, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 9869, "results": 0, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 10130, "results": 0, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 7009, "results": 1, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 2858, "results": 0, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"provider": "diy", "ms": 8118, "results": 0, "ok": true, "error": null}]','exp36_model_opus','[{"url": "https://www.opengovpartnership.org/members/albania/commitments/AL0079/", "snippet": "To ensure the portal\u2019s expansion meets the objectives of the commitment, a readiness assessment will be performed (milestone 2), and awareness campaigns (milestone 1) will be designed together with the institutions providing open data during 2023 and implemented, so as to familiarize and educate citizens and other stakeholders on the full range of applications of open data and explain how the portal can be used by them for various applications. ... To increase the usability of the Open Data portal, various activities shall be encouraged, such as the: 1. The involvement of academy and researchers 2. Trainings delivered to public administration 3. The involvement of start-ups and businesses 4. Etc", "title": "Adding Data to the Open Data Portal (AL0079)", "provider": "diy"}]');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_researcher_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,answer,answer_explanation,evidence_quote,source_url,retrieval_confidence,answer_confidence,search_queries_used,fetched_urls,domain_trust_score,language_route_used,notes,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,search_provider_calls,experiment_id,search_snippets) VALUES (9200,'2206f8e0-e541-4243-8cd3-e3d74cb9edb3','5c4d1a72-2a1e-4c9e-a02b-70a53513bebe','I13','AL',2,'yes','The World Bank documents that Albania''s digitally enabled government services improved in quality and usage, with e-Albania portal applications rising 40 percent, indicating measurable impact on government efficiency in delivering public services.','The quality of digitally enabled services has improved, accompanied by increased service usage. Notably, service applications completed through the e-Albania portal and mobile application rose by 40 percent.','https://www.worldbank.org/en/results/2025/07/03/transforming-institutions-for-inclusive-services-and-human-development-in-albania',0.85,0.55,'["e-Albania platform impact citizen services statistics report", "AKSHI raporti vjetor sh\u00ebrbime elektronike qytetar\u00eb efikasiteti", "Albania digital services 2400 online e-governance World Bank"]','["https://www.opengovpartnership.org/members/albania/commitments/AL0067/", "https://akshi.gov.al/samiti-digjital-boteror-2025-repishti-me-e-albania-2-0-sherbime-me-te-avancuar-per-qytetaret-dhe-bizneset/", "https://blogu.al/2025/11/sherbimet-e-reja-te-akshi-t-firme-elektronike-edhe-per-qytetaret/", "https://scantv.al/nga-e-hena-rikthehen-aplikimet-elektronike-per-lejet-e-ndertimit-akshi-ben-bilancin-nga-1225-sherbime-1214-jane-rikthyer", "https://www.worldbank.org/en/region/eca/brief/digital-transformation-and-public-sector-reform-western-balkans-progress-toward-eu-accession-and-economic-growth", "https://www.worldbank.org/en/results/2025/07/03/transforming-institutions-for-inclusive-services-and-human-development-in-albania", "https://www.worldbank.org/en/news/press-release/2025/03/10/world-bank-approves-additional-support-to-advance-albania-s-public-service-transformation", "https://www.opengovpartnership.org/members/albania/commitments/al0062/"]',0.3,'native',NULL,NULL,6110,904,15678,0.053149999999999996,'opus_o48',22,'claude-opus-4-8','Looking at the evidence, I need to focus on whether **open data** reuse is impacting government efficiency—not just e-government services generally.

