0eb sh\u00ebrbimeve n\u00eb e-Albania dhe n\u00eb portalin OpenData, t\u00eb publikohen automatikisht t\u00eb dh\u00ebna t\u00eb hapura q\u00eb vijn\u00eb nga vet\u00eb k\u00ebto sisteme. ... Bazuar tek ky ligj e kjo direktiv\u00eb po vijohet procesi p\u00ebr hartimin dhe miratimin e disa akteve n\u00ebnligjore brenda vitit 2023, nd\u00ebrsa do t\u00eb zhvillohen aktivitete sensibilizuese p\u00ebr promovimin e t\u00eb drejtave dhe detyrimeve t\u00eb parashikuara nga ky ligj brenda viteve 2023-2024.", "title": "AKSHI: Open Data do t\u00eb pasurohet me m\u00eb shum\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebna e", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://shqiptarja.com/lajm/akshi-open-data-do-te-pasurohet-me-me-shume-te-dhena-e-do-te-behet-edhe-me-i-aksesueshem-per-qytetaret", "snippet": "\u201cPlanet tona n\u00eb dy vitet e ardhshme do t\u00eb nisin nga kryerja e nj\u00eb Vler\u00ebsimi Gatishm\u00ebrie p\u00ebr t\u00eb Dh\u00ebnat e Hapura, \u00e7ka do t\u00eb na mund\u00ebsoj\u00eb t\u00eb kemi nj\u00eb pasqyr\u00eb t\u00eb sakt\u00eb t\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave t\u00eb hapura n\u00eb \u00e7do institucion. Fal\u00eb zbatimit t\u00eb standardeve, informacioni q\u00eb do t\u00eb publikohet n\u00eb Open Data do t\u00eb jet\u00eb m\u00eb cil\u00ebsor, teknikisht i sakt\u00eb dhe leht\u00ebsisht i aksesuesh\u00ebm dhe i rip\u00ebrdorsh\u00ebm\u201d, sakt\u00ebsoi Drejtoresha e Inovacionit dhe Promovimit t\u00eb e-Gov. ... Sistemet e ngritura elektronike, t\u00eb lidhura p\u00ebrmes rrjetit qeveritar GovNet, jo vet\u00ebm shk\u00ebmbejn\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebna fal\u00eb Platform\u00ebs Qeveritare t\u00eb Nd\u00ebrveprimit por b\u00ebjn\u00eb gjithashtu t\u00eb mundur q\u00eb, ve\u00e7 ofrimit t\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimeve n\u00eb e-Albania dhe n\u00eb portalin OpenData, t\u00eb publikohen automatikisht t\u00eb dh\u00ebna t\u00eb hapura q\u00eb vijn\u00eb nga vet\u00eb k\u00ebto sisteme. ... Angazhimi p\u00ebr ngritjen dhe pasurimin e m\u00ebtejsh\u00ebm t\u00eb portalit Open Data me t\u00eb dh\u00ebna ka qen\u00eb nd\u00ebr vite pjes\u00eb e Planeve Komb\u00ebtare t\u00eb Veprimit p\u00ebr Partneritetin p\u00ebr Qeverisje t\u00eb Hapur, n\u00ebn komponentin e qeverisjes digjitale\u201d, tha Kostani, e cila m\u00eb pas e vuri theksin edhe te Plani Komb\u00ebtar i Veprimit OGP 2023 \u2013 2025, miratuar s\u00eb fundmi nga qeveria, e tek mb\u00ebshtetja n\u00eb eksperienc\u00ebn e vendeve m\u00eb t\u00eb zhvilluara, p\u00ebrmes t\u00eb cilave do t\u00eb synohet q\u00eb Open Data t\u00eb pasurohet me m\u00eb shum\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebna, t\u00eb b\u00ebhet edhe", "title": "AKSHI: Open Data do t\u00eb pasurohet me m\u00eb shum\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebna e do t\u00eb ...", "provider": "diy"}]');
