h\u00ebna e", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://balkaninsight.com/2024/09/26/data-driven-governance-strategies-for-open-data-in-the-western-balkans/bi/", "snippet": "It is worth mentioning that many of the observed countries do not have guidelines, manuals, FAQs, comments/question forms, user feedback or similar services available on the website. Exceptions are North Macedonia and Serbia. The website of North Macedonia\u2019s open data has ten video tutorials on datasets \u2013 what is a dataset, formats, structure, how to create and publish it, licences, etc. In Serbia, there are different guides on how to put data on the website, how to set API, etc.", "title": "Data-Driven Governance: Strategies for Open Data in the Western ...", "provider": "diy"}]');
