rmation by enacting the new Open Data Law in April 2023. This legislation enhances the economy\u2019s legal alignment with the EU Open Data Directive,11 underscoring the importance of transparency and fair competition. While the law introduces novel concepts, s", "title": "Western Balkans Competitiveness Outlook 2024: Albania", "provider": "diy"}]');
