nt open-data portal \u2014 a custom DCAT-AP-compliant platform (Angular SPA over a bespoke REST API) with a SPARQL endpoint, harvested into data.europa.eu. It is not CKAN/DKAN.", "title": "api-evangelist/opendata-gov-al", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://shqiptarja.com/lajm/akshi-open-data-do-te-pasurohet-me-me-shume-te-dhena-e-do-te-behet-edhe-me-i-aksesueshem-per-qytetaret", "snippet": "\u201cPlanet tona n\u00eb dy vitet e ardhshme do t\u00eb nisin nga kryerja e nj\u00eb Vler\u00ebsimi Gatishm\u00ebrie p\u00ebr t\u00eb Dh\u00ebnat e Hapura, \u00e7ka do t\u00eb na mund\u00ebsoj\u00eb t\u00eb kemi nj\u00eb pasqyr\u00eb t\u00eb sakt\u00eb t\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave t\u00eb hapura n\u00eb \u00e7do institucion. Fal\u00eb zbatimit t\u00eb standardeve, informacioni q\u00eb do t\u00eb publikohet n\u00eb Open Data do t\u00eb jet\u00eb m\u00eb cil\u00ebsor, teknikisht i sakt\u00eb dhe leht\u00ebsisht i aksesuesh\u00ebm dhe i rip\u00ebrdorsh\u00ebm\u201d, sakt\u00ebsoi Drejtoresha e Inovacionit dhe Promovimit t\u00eb e-Gov.", "title": "AKSHI: Open Data do t\u00eb pasurohet me m\u00eb shum\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebna ...", "provider": "diy"}, {"url": "https://ogp.gov.al/faqe/open-data-101", "snippet": "T\u00eb Dh\u00ebnat e Hapura p\u00ebrkufizohen si t\u00eb dh\u00ebna t\u00eb strukturuara q\u00eb jan\u00eb t\u00eb lexueshme nga makina, t\u00eb shp\u00ebrndara lirisht, t\u00eb p\u00ebrdorura dhe t\u00eb nd\u00ebrtuara pa kufizime. ... Qeveria e Shqip\u00ebris\u00eb beson se \u00ebsht\u00eb e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme t''u sigurojm\u00eb qytetar\u00ebve qasje n\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat q\u00eb prodhohen, grumbullohen dhe p\u00ebrdoren nga administrata publike n\u00eb vendin ton\u00eb. \u00cbsht\u00eb po aq e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme q\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat t\u00eb vihen n\u00eb dispozicion p\u00ebrmes nj\u00eb dritareje t\u00eb vetme dhe t\u00eb k\u00ebrkueshme. Ne kemi t\u00eb dh\u00ebna t\u00eb konsoliduara nga t\u00eb gjitha departamentet qeveritare dhe agjencit\u00eb dhe