al. ... Open data policies which encourage the wide availability and re-use of public sector information for private or commercial purposes, with minimal or no legal technical or financial constraints, and which promote the circulation of information not only for economic operators but also for the public, can play an important role in kick-starting the development of new services based on novel ways to combine and make use of such information, stimulate economic growth and promote social engagement.", "title": "(Revised) PSI Directive Theme: Reuse", "provider": "diy"}]');
