scribes Malta''s digital strategy goals (better society, thriving economy) but does not demonstrate that the government has formally specified what ''impact of open data'' means as a concept. The quote conflates general digital strategy objectives with a concrete definition of open-data impact. Snippet [4] mentions ''open data'' and ''data governance frameworks'' but does not quote any explicit definition of impact. The Researcher''s moderate confidence (0.45) and notes acknowledge this gap.','Malta Diġitali 2022-2027 strategy focuses on the transformation that is required through the digital aspect, aiming at a better society and a thriving economy.','https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/digital-connectivity-malta','Malta open data policy definition impact measurement framework 2022-2027',NULL,5876,694,7967,0.009346,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
