    "Data and Trust: promote open data, data governance frameworks and interoperability, and align with EU instruments (including the Data Governance Act)"
  ],
  "rejection_reason": "Evidence fit failure: The quoted passage describes Malta''s digital strategy goals (better society, thriving economy) but does not demonstrate that the government has formally specified what ''impact of open data'' means as a concept. The quote conflates general digital strategy objectives with a concrete definition of open-data impact. Snippet [4] mentions ''open data'' and ''data governance frameworks'' but does not quote any explicit definition of impact. The Researcher''s moderate confidence (0.45) and notes acknowledge this gap.",
  "counter_evidence_quote": "Malta Diġitali 2022-2027 strategy focuses on the transformation that is required through the digital aspect, aiming at a better society and a thriving economy.",
  "counter_source_url": "https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/digital-connectivity-malta",
  "suggested_search_query": "Malta open data policy definition impact measurement framework 2022-2027"
