 the commitments arising from its membership in the Open Government Partnership (OGP), the introduction of e-government in order to provide better public service to the public, providing a legal f", "This version of the Malta Data Portal is designed to enable a shared platform for the management and support of metadata about Registers and Datasets emanating mainly from the laws of Malta and EU Regulations.", "Open MaltaA Data Transparency Platform\n\nMalta''s political money and disclosure records in one place."]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6082,691,8562,0.009537,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
