Y 4.0 and CC0. The Researcher correctly acknowledges that Malta-specific sources (data.gov.mt or national open data strategy) would be required to answer definitively, but provided no evidence that such guidelines exist or what they contain. The independent searches also failed to retrieve Malta-specific policy documents.','The search did not retrieve Malta-specific policy documents. To answer definitively, access to data.gov.mt''s official guidelines or Malta''s national open data strategy would be required.',NULL,'Malta national open data policy 2024 licensing requirements OR site:data.gov.mt licensing guidelines OR Malta digital strategy open data licensing',NULL,6130,505,6732,0.008655,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
