  "counter_evidence_quote": "The page provides an assessment on the impact of the data... [which] follows the structure of the EU maturity report 2021 for measuring the impact of data. The EU maturity reports, ''dimension 2'' on Open Data Impact, has the following structure: Strategic awareness - Political Impact - Social Impact - Environmental impact - Economic impact",
