 your metadata for a typical researcher (who might even be you!) 30+ years from now - what will they need to understand what''s inside yo", "Special Note to Publishers: Please review the first checklist below so you''ll know what metadatayour conversion vendor needsfrom you.\n- CHECKLIST 1: Required Metadata Supplied by Publisher (not default or vendor-supplied)\n- Complete Title\n- Author(s)/editor(s)/illustrator(s) \u2013 required only if prese"]','Evidence fit failure: The quoted passage describes the Malta Data Portal''s general purpose (a platform for managing metadata) but does not address whether Malta publishes guidelines or tools to assist publishers in publishing high-quality metadata. The Researcher correctly identified insufficient evidence but then returned ''inconclusive'' rather than conducting targeted follow-up searches of the portal''s documentation sections, support pages, or guidance resources that would directly answer the binary question.','The search snippets reference generic open data publishing guidelines and European metadata standards (DCAT-AP, EDP documentation) but contain no specific evidence that Malta publishes its own guidelines or tools for publishers.',NULL,'site:data.gov.mt guidelines metadata publishers OR site:data.gov.mt publishing tools metadata OR Malta National Statistics Office metadata guidance',NULL,5882,531,6924,0.008537000000000001,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
