  "rejection_reason": "The Researcher cites data.overheid.nl as the source, which is a forbidden ODMI source because the URL contains ''assessment-impact-data'' elements related to the ODMI questionnaire itself. The evidence quote describes search ranking incentives and data communities, but does not establish whether there are formal activities, incentives, or obligations for public bodies to *monitor* reuse of their own data—only that the portal makes visible which datasets have reuse. The distinction between portal visibility and formal monitoring obligations is material to the question.",
  "counter_evidence_quote": "data.overheid.nl is the national data portal itself and its assessment document is part of the ODMI validation ground truth. Independent snippets reveal legislative frameworks (Wet hergebruik overheidsinformatie, DGA implementation) but do not explicitly confirm monitoring obligations or incentives for public bodies.",
  "counter_source_url": "https://data.overheid.nl/assessment-impact-data-2021",
