  ],
  "rejection_reason": "The Researcher''s evidence describes a voluntary practice (''started'', ''is indicated'') rather than a legal mandate. The quote states that ministries ''started'' an annual inventory in 2015, which describes adoption of a practice, not a statutory requirement. The independent search results reference the 2024 implementation of the EU Open Data Directive (Wet implementatie Open data richtlijn), which may have introduced new legal requirements, but the Researcher''s evidence predates this legislative change and does not establish that the pre-2024 inventory practice was mandated by law. The distinction between ''a practice adopted by all ministries'' and ''a legally mandated requirement'' is material to this question.",
