    "Assessment of the Impact of data 2021 - Data overheid — This page provides an assessment on the impact of the data that is available on data.overheid.nl. The assessment follows the structure of the EU maturity report 2021 for measuring the impact of data.",
    "het gebruik van haar open data is in de afgelopen jaren explosief gestegen. Slechts vier jaar geleden startte het CBS met een open dataportaal",
    "Open data | CBS — Open Data is data that can freely be used and is made available in a machine-readable format."
  ],
  "rejection_reason": "The cited evidence does not answer the question. The quote concerns CBS''s administrative burden reduction goals, not whether surveys are used to measure open data reuse. The Researcher''s own notes acknowledge that no evidence of dedicated reuse measurement surveys was found, yet they answered ''no'' with only 0.60 confidence based on absence of evidence rather than positive evidence of absence.",
  "counter_evidence_quote": "Assessment of the Impact of data 2021 - Data overheid — This page provides an assessment on the impact of the data that is available on data.overheid.nl. The assessment follows the structure of the EU maturity report 2021 for measuring the impact of data.",
  "counter_source_url": "https://data.overheid.nl/",
