independent verification through academic or research institutions. While the independent search results show that CBS publishes environmental data dashboards and KNMI provides open climate data, none of the retrieved snippets provide evidence of systematic research quantifying the *impact created by open data reuse* on environmental challenges—which is the specific requirement of the question.','The independent search found only general environmental data platforms (CBS Dashboard, KNMI, Rijksoverheid climate information) but no evidence of research studies or impact assessments specifically quantifying how open data reuse has contributed to addressing environmental challenges or the European Green Deal.',NULL,'RIVM open data environmental impact assessment Netherlands OR KNAW research open data reuse climate mitigation Netherlands OR Nederlandse universiteiten open data milieu effect onderzoek',NULL,6318,791,10150,0.010273000000000001,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
