  "rejection_reason": "The cited evidence describes which datasets *will be published* versus which *will remain closed*, but does not explicitly confirm that the inventory itself includes/tracks datasets that cannot be published under the EU Data Governance Act (2022/868). The distinction matters: a data inventory may list only publishable-or-future-publishable datasets, excluding non-publishable ones entirely. The Researcher''s interpretation conflates ''datasets that remain closed for legal reasons like personal data'' (which pre-date the DGA) with the specific statutory exclusions under EU 2022/868. The independent search results do not clarify whether Netherlands inventories affirmatively include DGA-exempt data or exclude them from tracking.",
