ok andere datasets van de overheid zijn vrij toegankelijk. Bijvoorbeeld het Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek, de Kiesraad en het Kadaster. ", "In slechts 4 stappen van Open Data ambities naar het daadwerkelijk openstellen van data voor hergebruik! Dat kan met deze Handreiking Open Data. Deze Handreiking helpt overheidsorganisaties met Open Data ambities. Het vormt als het ware de eerstelijns hulp en het beoogt 90% van alle vragen die spele", "Zo staan op data.overheid.nl beschikbare open datasets van de Nederlandse overheid.", "According to the statistics page of data.overheid.nl, the Ministry of the Interior and Kingdom Relations has handled 615 data requests since 1 January 2015.", "The tables which can be viewed and downloaded in StatLine are also available as open data. The collection of datasets can be searched in the StatLine data portal. All datasets from StatLine are also part of the open data collection of the Dutch government, called data.overheid.nl (Dutch).", "over 150 Dutch government organisations list their available data in over 12.000 datasets", "In 2016 CBS (Statistics Netherlands) invented the concept of the Urban Data Centres. City data are improved through the combination with national data and data-expertise available at the CBS through which smart, data-driven cities were created."]','The Researcher''s ''no'' answer lacks adequate evidentiary support. The cited CBS quote discusses inventory assessment of coverage and openness, not monitoring of reuse. The independent search results show that data.overheid.nl maintains statistics on data requests (615 since 2015) and that the Dutch government actively promotes reuse, but do not definitively establish whether formal processes specifically monitor the level of reuse. The evidence is insufficient to confidently conclude that no monitoring processes exist.','According to the statistics page of data.overheid.nl, the Ministry of the Interior and Kingdom Relations has handled 615 data requests since 1 January 2015.','https://www.europeandataportal.eu/en/highlights/national-open-data-agenda-nl0019','data.overheid.nl statistics page reuse metrics monitoring',NULL,6156,822,10329,0.010266,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
