ate the existence of a formal, publicly available document describing the governance structure and detailed responsibilities of the open data team. The question specifically asks for ''a document'' with governance structure information—general responsibility statements on a web page do not constitute such a document. The independent search queries found no evidence of a dedicated, formal governance document.','The data.overheid.nl team is responsible for implementing part of the open government policy: making available data sets findable and providing support to government organisations with opening data.','https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/algemeen/over-dataoverheidnl','data.overheid.nl governance structure document organizational charter',NULL,5891,734,9350,0.009561,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
