sets; DCAT-AP is the European application profile that decides which DCAT properties are mandatory and pins controlled vocabularies to EU Authority Tables; DCAT-AP-NL 3.0 (Geonovu", "Publish and harvest a catalog with DCAT-AP\nScope a catalog to your DCAT register, publish with one date field, and expose it as a DCAT-AP-NL feed that data.overheid.nl can harvest.", "To promote the interoperability and accessibility of datasets subject to the HVD IR, a DCAT-AP HVD metadata profile was introduced to govern the provision of metadata for these datasets.", "In order to support the interoperability of health data (for secondary use) in the EHDS, a new standard has been developed: HealthDCAT-AP. It aims to establish standardised description of datasets for all health catalogues. Such metadata standard will improve the interoperability and findability of ", "DCAT-AP for High-Value Datasets (HVD) is an annex for the DCAT Application Profile that is based on the Data Catalogue Vocabulary (DCAT) developed by W3C.", "DCAT-AP-SE is a metadata specification introduced for the purpose of describing datasets. More specifically, DCAT-AP-SE is a Swedish adaption (a profile) of the European metadata specification DCAT-AP. DCAT-AP in turn, is an adaption (profile) of the W3C recommendation DCAT."]','The Researcher correctly identified the critical gap: the evidence describes a high-value dataset classification system but does not explicitly confirm implementation of the DCAT-AP High Value Datasets tag mechanism in the portal''s metadata. The question asks specifically whether the DCAT-AP HVD tag is implemented; describing general high-value dataset awareness is insufficient evidence. The independent search results reference DCAT-AP-DONL (Dutch profile) and DCAT-AP HVD guidelines but do not provide definitive proof that the Netherlands portal has actually deployed the HVD tag. This is a material distinction between policy/awareness and technical implementation.','The Dutch government has translated the DCAT-AP-EU into a Dutch application profile (DCAT-AP-DONL), but the search results do not confirm whether the HVD tag extension has been integrated into this profile or actively used on data.overheid.nl.','https://data.overheid.nl/en/','DCAT-AP-DONL high value datasets implementation status Netherlands 2024',NULL,6214,1038,12106,0.011404000000000001,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
