r. 124/2024 \"P\u00ebr mbrojtjen e t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave personale\", si edhe Udh\u00ebzimit t\u00eb P\u00ebrbashk\u00ebt nr. 2, dat\u00eb 6.2.2025 p\u00ebr miratimin e licenc\u00ebs standarde t\u00eb rip\u00ebrdorimit t\u00eb informac"]','The Researcher correctly identified that the cited source describes Law 33/2022 implementation but does not provide evidence of whether public bodies have actually developed systematic classification systems for reuse cases. The independent search results do not reveal any systematic classification framework either. The Researcher''s inconclusive verdict is appropriate given the evidence gap, but this indicates the claim cannot be verified rather than passing verification.','The IDP Commissioner''s report on Law 33/2022 implementation is the most relevant source but the snippet does not detail whether reuse cases are systematically classified.',NULL,'Albania IDP Commissioner Law 33/2022 implementation report reuse cases classification framework systematic',NULL,6061,651,8816,0.009316000000000001,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
