The Researcher''s "inconclusive" answer is defensible given the gap, but verification requires either: (1) access to the full IDP report''s content proving classification systems exist, or (2) a more direct source describing Albania''s actual reuse case classification methodology. I recommend searching the full IDP report or contacting the Commissioner''s office directly for the specific classification framework details.','2026-07-12 13:59:48','exp32_model_haiku');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_verifier_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,strategy_label,researcher_run_id,verdict,verifier_answer,verifier_confidence,substring_check_result,substring_check_notes,independent_search_queries,independent_evidence,rejection_reason,counter_evidence_quote,counter_source_url,suggested_search_query,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,experiment_id) VALUES (5201,'d33b591d-8bc1-41bb-b348-3970d734682e','dbaf53bf-0c8f-49e7-b4de-4e500602cd20','I13','AL',3,'verifier-disprove',8717,'pass','inconclusive',0.85,'pass','matched against snippet 0 the Researcher read (1 fragment(s))','["Albania government open data impact public services efficiency", "Albanian open data reuse cases government effectiveness", "Shembuj p\u00ebrdorimi t\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave t\u00eb hapura n\u00eb Shqip\u00ebri sektorit publik"]','["To strengthen institutional enablers of an efficient public sector, the Open Data Portal has been upgraded to enhance user experience and align with international best practices for open data. Additionally, the Government Gateway\u2014the digital platform for inter-agency data sharing to support public s", "Albania | https://opendata.gov.al | CKAN* | 89 | 20 ... A Framework for Evaluation and Improvement of Open Government Data Quality: Application to the Western Balkans National Open Data Portals", "In advancing data accessibility, Albania has integrated open data policy measures in its broader national Open Government Partnership (OGP) Action Plan for 2023-25. The economy has strengthened its legal framework for reusing public sector information by enacting the new Open Data Law in April 2023.", "Governments have to benefit from this data deluge to use its different aspects such as fraud detection or to measure citizen''s needs and desire for services in different area such as finance, healthcare, environment, economic and social statistics, etc.", "Qeveria e Shqip\u00ebris\u00eb beson se \u00ebsht\u00eb e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme t''u sigurojm\u00eb qytetar\u00ebve qasje n\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat q\u00eb prodhohen, grumbullohen dhe p\u00ebrdoren nga administrata publike n\u00eb vendin ton\u00eb. \u00cbsht\u00eb po aq e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme q\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat t\u00eb vihen n\u00eb dispozicion p\u00ebrmes nj\u00eb dritareje t\u00eb vetme dhe t\u00eb k\u00ebrkueshme. Ne kemi t\u00eb dh"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6163,711,9437,0.009718000000000001,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
