bsin e modelit p\u00ebr ta aktivizuar ose \u00e7aktivizuar kalimin automatik."]','The evidence quote describes the general definition of an open-data portal (access, use, redistribution) but does not address whether Albania''s portal specifically implements automated feedback mechanisms tracking user access. The absence of evidence is not evidence of absence. Independent searches returned technical details about the platform architecture and available datasets, but no information confirming or denying the presence of automated feedback mechanisms.','opendata.gov.al is a custom, DCAT-AP-compliant platform (an Angular single-page-app front end over a bespoke REST API) with CKAN implementation','https://opendata.gov.al/','Albania opendata.gov.al feedback mechanism user tracking analytics features documentation',NULL,5849,510,6606,0.008399,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
