e overview of key trends across three dimensions: environment and climate; socio-economic change; and system change (energy, mobility and food) in the country. It highlights the main developments and challenges in these areas, including measures to suppor"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6085,680,8536,0.009485,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
