force on 16 July 2019. It consisted of a revision of the public sector information directive from 2003, which was alre", "The Directive (EU) 2019/1024 on open data and the re-use of public sector information known as the PSI Directive, was passed by the European Parliament and the Council of the European Union and sets a framework for the distribution of data managed by the public sector in the European Union.", "The law has undergone amendments, notably Law No. 78/2023, which expanded proactive disclosures, refined exceptions for classified information, and strengthened enforcement through the Commissioner''s expanded powers, without altering core access rights.", "The results of this analysis show that the fiscal system in Albania contributes to reducing inequality. Households who have more pay more, while households who are less well-off receive more of the benefits from social spending. This progressivity that characterizes the fiscal system in Albania \u2013 pa", "Kostoja e Borxhit Publik llogaritet si shum\u00eb e interesave t\u00eb Borxhit t\u00eb Brendsh\u00ebm dhe t\u00eb Borxhit t\u00eb Jasht\u00ebm q\u00eb paguan Shteti sipas marr\u00ebveshjeve t\u00eb kredive t\u00eb pashlyera, n\u00eb nj\u00eb vit t\u00eb caktuar."]','The Researcher''s answer is ''inconclusive'', but the evidence provided does not substantiate this verdict. The OECD quote confirms Albania enacted an Open Data Law in April 2023 aligned with EU Directive 2019/1024, but does not address whether processes exist to assess marginal-cost compliance. The Researcher''s own notes acknowledge that ''search results do not reveal any actual processes, procedures, or governance mechanisms for assessing marginal cost compliance.'' This is material evidence for a ''no'' answer, not ''inconclusive''. The independent searches also returned no evidence of Albanian assessment mechanisms. The Researcher should either answer ''no'' (no evidence of such processes found) or conduct more targeted searches of Albania''s Open Data Law text and implementing regulations before claiming inconclusiveness.','The search results do not reveal any actual processes, procedures, or governance mechanisms for assessing marginal cost compliance.',NULL,'Albania Open Data Law 2023 full text implementation regulation marginal cost assessment procedures',NULL,6330,721,8876,0.009935,'haiku_h45',23,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
