.mt Malta open data portal page view statistics analytics dashboard',NULL,3939,787,13018,0.03937,'opus_o48',23,'claude-opus-4-8','The evidence has a fundamental fit problem. The quote is from a privacy policy about IP-address session tracking, which is unrelated to whether the portal monitors most/least consulted pages via analytics. A site can decline to track individual users while still monitoring aggregate page-view popularity. The privacy policy is also for opengov.gov.mt, not necessarily the data portal (data.gov.mt / Malta Data Portal).

