ent of the Impact of data 2021'' covering the social dimension and an education-data impact community (Inspectie van het Onderwijs), both hosted on the Dutch government portal data.overheid.nl. These support a confident ''yes'' rather than ''inconclusive''.','This impact assessment captures these elements. The re-use examples of each dimension (political, social, environmental, economic) help infer a degree of open data impact in the respective field.','https://data.overheid.nl/','Assessment of the Impact of data 2021 data.overheid.nl social dimension',NULL,4298,979,16897,0.045965000000000006,'opus_o48',23,'claude-opus-4-8','The Researcher answered "inconclusive," but the independent snippets reveal authoritative evidence that impact data exists.

