The cited quote concerns GDPR personal-data rights (inspect/retrieve/correct), which is materially distinct from measures to incentivise the publication of and access to *citizen-generated* data. None of the independent snippets ground a confident ''yes'' or a verbatim ''no''. The Researcher''s ''inconclusive'' verdict is defensible and the evidence fit is genuinely weak for a positive claim. Verdict stands.','2026-07-12 18:08:34','exp36_model_opus');
