The source is the authoritative Dutch national data portal (data.overheid.nl), not a forbidden ODMI/EU source. The quote directly answers the question: the national portal harvests all Dutch datasets to the European Data Portal, fostering discoverability on data.europa.eu. Independent snippets corroborate rather than contradict, and no counter-evidence of a missing policy or harvesting failure was found.','2026-07-12 18:08:41','exp36_model_opus');
