 better understand quality issues in open data portals and study the impact of improvement methods over time. ... For this purpose, a b"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4290,905,13389,0.044074999999999996,'opus_o48',23,'claude-opus-4-8','Let me work through the checks.

**Substring check:** PASS — verified by Python, quote appears verbatim in snippet [3].

