lished in the Environmental Data Compendium, an online resource that offers information on the environment, nature and space in the Netherlands','https://www.cbs.nl/en-gb/corporate/2023/34/statistics-on-nature-play-crucial-role-in-national-and-international-policy','Netherlands open data reuse case biodiversity air water quality impact example URL',NULL,4198,845,15619,0.042115,'opus_o48',23,'claude-opus-4-8','The evidence describes environmental data being published, but it does not confirm a discrete reuse case with the required URLs, nor does it directly establish an *impact* of open data reuse on biodiversity protection. The question specifically asks for a reuse case demonstrating impact — the quote only confirms data publication, not reuse impact. The Researcher''s own notes admit no discrete reuse case with URLs exists in the evidence.

