The source is authoritative (digitaleoverheid.nl, a Dutch government portal, not a forbidden ODMI source). The quote directly demonstrates national-level facilitation: Ministry of BZK funds VNG to support municipalities'' implementation capacity. Independent snippets [3], [5], and [8] corroborate that the Rijksoverheid/BZK and VNG facilitate and support local/regional data initiatives at national level. Snippet [3] notes municipalities lag despite this support — which confirms the support exists (the question asks whether the structure ensures facilitation, not whether it fully succeeds). All four checks pass.','2026-07-12 18:20:48','exp36_model_opus');
