INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_verifier_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,strategy_label,researcher_run_id,verdict,verifier_answer,verifier_confidence,substring_check_result,substring_check_notes,independent_search_queries,independent_evidence,rejection_reason,counter_evidence_quote,counter_source_url,suggested_search_query,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,experiment_id) VALUES (5403,'2206f8e0-e541-4243-8cd3-e3d74cb9edb3','e28834b2-f0f1-4052-b9ca-59d9845595e4','I2','AL',3,'verifier-disprove',9196,'pass','inconclusive',0.6,'pass','matched against snippet 1 the Researcher read (1 fragment(s))','["Shqip\u00ebri monitorim rip\u00ebrdorimi t\u00eb dh\u00ebna t\u00eb hapura", "open data Albania reuse monitoring statistics report", "AKSHI open.data.gov.al statistika p\u00ebrdorimi shkarkime"]','["Zyra e Komisionerit p\u00ebr t\u00eb Drejt\u00ebn e Informimit dhe Mbrojtjen e t\u00eb Dh\u00ebnave Personale ka publikuar raportin mbi zbatimin e ligjit nr. 33/2022 \u201cP\u00ebr t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat e hapura dhe rip\u00ebrdorimin e informacionit t\u00eb sektorit publik\u201d, duke ofruar nj\u00eb pasqyr\u00eb t\u00eb plot\u00eb t\u00eb nivelit t\u00eb zbatimit t\u00eb k\u00ebtij kuadri ligjor n\u00eb", "P\u00ebrkrahje p\u00ebr inovacion - Qasja n\u00eb burimet e dijes n\u00eb form\u00eb t\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave mb\u00ebshtet inovacionin n\u00eb sektorin privat duke reduktuar dublikimet dhe duke promovuar rip\u00ebrdorimin e burimeve ekzistuese. Disponueshm\u00ebria e t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave n\u00eb form\u00eb t\u00eb lexueshme nga kompjuteri lejon grumbullime kreative q\u00eb mund t\u00eb p", "T\u00eb dh\u00ebnat e hapura dhe rip\u00ebrdorimi i tyre\nKjo rubrik\u00eb u krijua n\u00eb zbatim t\u00eb\nLigjit nr.33/2022\n\u201cP\u00ebr t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat e hapura dhe rip\u00ebrdorimin e informacionit t\u00eb sektorit publik\u201d.", "P\u00ebr zbatimin e k\u00ebtij ligji, nj\u00eb rol ky\u00e7 luan Komisioneri p\u00ebr t\u00eb Drejt\u00ebn e Informimit dhe Mbrojtjen e t\u00eb Dh\u00ebnave Personale, i cili mbik\u00ebqyr dhe promovon respektimin e dispozitave ligjore. Sipas nenit 19 t\u00eb ligjit, ky institucion \u00ebsht\u00eb p\u00ebrgjegj\u00ebs p\u00ebr monitorimin e zbatimit t\u00eb rregullave p\u00ebr t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat ", "Among the main findings of the report, it results that 177 institutions have approved and published the list of open data, 187 institutions have created the \u201cOpen Data\u201d section on their official websites and 195 institutions have designated contact persons for open data.", "Because location-based information makes statistics easier to interpret and analyze, the platform now serves a wide audience\u2014including residents, businesses, academics, researchers, and government agencies. Open access encourages reuse across different systems and applications. Data is free to downl", "Portali Open Data ofron m\u00eb shum\u00eb se 90 grupe t\u00eb dh\u00ebnash n\u00eb fushat e sh\u00ebndet\u00ebsis\u00eb, arsimit, siguris\u00eb publike, buxhetit, e-qeverisjes, etj. Sistemet e ngritura elektronike, t\u00eb lidhura p\u00ebrmes rrjetit qeveritar GovNet, jo vet\u00ebm shk\u00ebmbejn\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebna fal\u00eb Platform\u00ebs Qeveritare t\u00eb Nd\u00ebrveprimit por b\u00ebjn\u00eb gji"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5385,1168,24556,0.05612500000000001,'opus_o48',23,'claude-opus-4-8','The Researcher answered "inconclusive" with a weak quote that doesn''t describe any monitoring process. Let me assess whether the independent evidence supports a confident answer.

The snippets reveal reports on the implementation of Law 33/2022 on open data and reuse, and the Commissioner''s oversight role. Snippet [5] mentions specific findings (177 institutions published lists, 187 created "Open Data" sections) — this is monitoring of open data publication, but not specifically monitoring the *level of reuse*. The evidence describes oversight of legal compliance and publication, not a reuse-level monitoring process (download tracking, usage analytics, reuse reporting).

The Researcher''s quote itself is about increasing access to downloads, which does not confirm a monitoring process. Neither the cited quote nor the independent snippets clearly establish a dedicated reuse-monitoring process. "Inconclusive" is defensible given the ambiguity — the evidence is insufficient to confidently answer "yes" or "no".

I agree with the "inconclusive" verdict. The evidence quote passes substring but does not answer the question, and the independent snippets show related activity (oversight, compliance reports) without confirming a reuse-level monitoring process specifically.

