istics that allow citizens, businesses, non- governmental organizations, civil society organizations, res", "In Albania, most of the provided data sets are from 2019, with a few exceptions. The latest updates from these institutions are made by the Ministry of Health and Social Protection, National Agency of ICT, AKSHI, and the Ministry of Finance and Economy (in 2024). ... The data available cannot be mer"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4184,610,14726,0.036169999999999994,'opus_o48',23,'claude-opus-4-8','The Researcher''s evidence quote is about the OGP Action Plan generally—it does not address time-series completeness at all. The Researcher self-identified this and answered "inconclusive," which is the honest verdict given the evidence.

