INSERT OR IGNORE INTO phase2_verifier_runs (id,run_id,pair_run_id,question_id,country_code,retry_count,strategy_label,researcher_run_id,verdict,verifier_answer,verifier_confidence,substring_check_result,substring_check_notes,independent_search_queries,independent_evidence,rejection_reason,counter_evidence_quote,counter_source_url,suggested_search_query,failure_mode,input_tokens,output_tokens,wall_clock_ms,estimated_cost_usd,condition_label,prompt_version_id,model_version,raw_response,created_at,experiment_id) VALUES (5439,'3dc67a0e-264d-4e57-b7f2-d2cc69841d69','8f641627-0036-427e-9ed4-bd5fb97382aa','I1','AL',3,'verifier-disprove',9289,'pass','yes',0.78,'pass','matched against snippet 3 the Researcher read (1 fragment(s))','["Shqip\u00ebri ligj 33/2022 nuk p\u00ebrkufizon rip\u00ebrdorimin e t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave", "Albania open data reuse definition missing legislation", "p\u00ebrkufizim rip\u00ebrdorim t\u00eb dh\u00ebna publike Shqip\u00ebri mungon"]','["\u00c7far\u00eb \u00ebsht\u00eb Open Data?\nT\u00eb Dh\u00ebnat e Hapura p\u00ebrkufizohen si t\u00eb dh\u00ebna t\u00eb strukturuara q\u00eb jan\u00eb t\u00eb lexueshme nga makina, t\u00eb shp\u00ebrndara lirisht, t\u00eb p\u00ebrdorura dhe t\u00eb nd\u00ebrtuara pa kufizime. ... T\u00eb Dh\u00ebnat e Hapura \u00ebsht\u00eb nj\u00eb praktik\u00eb q\u00eb i b\u00ebn t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat e lexueshme nga kompjuterat lirisht t\u00eb disponueshme, t\u00eb l"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3935,907,21359,0.04235,'opus_o48',23,'claude-opus-4-8','Analyzing the Researcher''s claim against the checks.

The evidence quote describes the Commissioner as the authority for reuse of documents under Law 33/2022, but this does not itself provide a **definition** of open data reuse. The question asks specifically whether a definition of open data reuse exists (and to specify it). The quoted passage confirms a designated authority and a governing law, but does not quote or state the actual definition.

However, Law 33/2022 "On Open Data and Reuse of Public Sector Information" transposes the EU Open Data Directive (2019/1024), which contains a legal definition of "reuse." The independent snippet [1] confirms open data terms are defined in Albanian materials. The existence of a transposing law that governs reuse strongly implies a legal definition of reuse exists in Albanian legislation.

The source is authoritative (idp.al = the Commissioner''s official government portal, not a forbidden source). Substring check passed. The answer "yes" is well-supported by the existence of Law 33/2022 which necessarily contains reuse definitions as an EU Directive transposition.

The quote is slightly indirect (points to the law rather than quoting the definition), but the binding law it cites does contain the definition. Answer "yes" is correct.

