e evidence from the responsible government agency itself.','https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/data-publiceren/inventarisaties','In 2015, all ministries started an annual government-wide data inventory. It is indicated per department which datasets are available for publication and reuse, which datasets will be published in the long term and which datasets will remain closed due to personal data, for example.',NULL,5133,476,6602,0.007513000000000001,29,'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001','```json
