  "chosen_source_url": "https://dig.watch/resource/digital-agenda-of-albania-2022-2026",
  "chosen_evidence_quote": "Platforms like Opendata.gov.al will promote transparency by publishing government data in accessible formats. Feedback loops will ensure citizen input is incorporated into service improvements, fostering trust and accountability."
