The DCAT standard is used as a standard to exchange descriptions (metadata) of datasets and dataservices.','https://data.overheid.nl/en/ondersteuning/algemeen/over-dataoverheidnl',0.85,0.8,0,0,0,9518,1194,26986,0.07744,NULL,'2026-07-12 18:26:10','exp36_model_opus');
